# The Vercel project's Root Directory is `backend`, so the Flutter half of the repo
# is already outside the build context — keep "Include files outside root directory"
# switched OFF and none of android/, ios/, lib/, assets/ or the keystores can ever be
# uploaded. What is left to exclude is the part of backend/ that is dev-only and has
# no business inside a function bundle.
test/
tool/
db/migrate.mjs
db/seed.mjs
